11, APPLICATIONS OF THEORETICAL CHEMISTRY (Kao)\n\nA.~ Objective: Develop. the necessary algorithms and software to study\nBhysical properties of flavor and tobacco related molecules;\nutilize these techniques to model tobacco smoke and pyrolysis\n\nchemistry,\n\n. Results and Plans: Efforts to extend the MOMM approach to\n\u2018hitrogen-containing aromatic \u2018compounds are progressing. The\nrecent publication of cis-trans isomerization energies of sone\nbridgenead azoathanes has forced us to reexamine our previously\ndeveloped torce field parameters. Certain parameters have now\nbeen \u201ctine-tuned\u2019\u2019 to reflect the new experimental data. The ab\ninitio calculations of model compounds for:C-nitroso compounds and\nnitrites have now been completed and the force tield development\nfor these classes of compounds. ate underway.\n\nWith regard to theoretical mechanistic studies of the glycerol\nacrolein reaction, eiforts continue in the investigation of the Fi\npossible dehydration mechanisms. by locating relevant transit ion=",
